Provenance of this directory (VoicePlus, task R5.1)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Swift sources in this directory were copied into VoicePlus from the
MIT-licensed Muesli project (the MIT notice above is Muesli's), which in turn
vendored them from FluidAudio (https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio)
v0.15.1, `Sources/FluidAudio/ASR/Qwen3/`, under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The Apache-2.0 text that covers the vendored code is in LICENSE-Apache-2.0 next
to this file. Every ported file keeps an attribution header naming both origins.
Changes made while porting: types renamed from the `MuesliQwen3` prefix to a
`Qwen3` prefix, `@available(macOS 15, *)` gates added, the log subsystem changed
to VoicePlus's, Muesli's managed-download entry points removed (VoicePlus
resolves and provisions the weights in `Qwen3Weights.swift`), and an optional
context-prompt parameter added to the prompt builder.

The Qwen3-ASR model weights themselves are published by Alibaba/Qwen under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 and are downloaded at runtime; they are not part of
this repository.
